msgid "STM32G474RET6 / MB1367 initial vertical slice"
msgstr "STM32G474RET6／MB1367 首批纵切片"

msgid ""
"This is a source-reviewed STM32G474RET6 baseline for NUCLEO-G474RE. It "
"implements CPU startup, a fixed clock transaction, TIM2 time, GPIOA, LPUART1"
" IRQ bytes and independent PA0/PA1 EXTI edge events. It does not establish "
"Flash programming, DMA, ADC, SPI, I2C, FDCAN, USB, Ethernet, low-power "
"continuity or other G4 peripheral support. Unsupported modes must fail the "
"configuration resolver. Actual PCB inspection and all HIL remain not "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"这是 NUCLEO-G474RE 上经源码审阅的 STM32G474RET6 基线，实现 CPU startup、固定 clock "
"transaction、TIM2 time、GPIOA、LPUART1 IRQ bytes 和独立 PA0／PA1 EXTI edge "
"event。不建立 Flash 编程、DMA、ADC、SPI、I2C、FDCAN、USB、Ethernet、低功耗连续性或其他 G4 "
"外设支持。不支持模式必须在配置解析时失败。真实 PCB 检查与全部 HIL 均未执行。"

