msgid "Exact target and memory"
msgstr "精确目标与内存"

msgid ""
"The initial target is STM32G474RET6, Cortex-M4F, ARMv7E-M, FPv4-SP-D16 hard "
"ABI, DSP and DWT CYCCNT. External IRQ IDs cover 0..101, including TIM2=28, "
"LPUART1=91 and FMAC=101. Four priority bits are implemented."
msgstr ""
"首目标为 STM32G474RET6、Cortex-M4F、ARMv7E-M、FPv4-SP-D16 hard ABI、DSP 和 DWT "
"CYCCNT。外部 IRQ ID 0..101，包含 TIM2=28、LPUART1=91、FMAC=101，实现四个优先级位。"

msgid ""
"Flash is 512 KiB at 0x08000000. Startup checks observed DEV_ID 0x469, Flash "
"density 512 KiB and actual DBANK=1. DEV_ID identifies a silicon category, "
"not the package or order code. DBANK=1 yields 2 KiB pages across two banks; "
"DBANK=0 is rejected by this first geometry profile. Startup never writes "
"option bytes or performs erase or programming. A product must verify the "
"exact order code and option state."
msgstr ""
"Flash 为 0x08000000 起 512 KiB。Startup 检查观察 DEV_ID 0x469、Flash density 512 KiB"
" 及实际 DBANK=1。DEV_ID 标识硅片类别，不标识封装或订货号。DBANK=1 是跨两 bank 的 2 KiB page；首 "
"geometry profile 拒绝 DBANK=0。Startup 绝不写 option bytes 或擦除／编程。产品须核对精确订货号和 "
"option 状态。"

msgid ""
"RAM consists of 80 KiB SRAM1 at 0x20000000, 16 KiB SRAM2 at 0x20014000, and "
"32 KiB CCM with a system-bus alias at 0x20018000. The CCM CPU address "
"0x10000000 aliases the same physical storage and is not counted again. The "
"first linker layout uses one contiguous 128 KiB region at 0x20000000 and "
"reserves 2048 bytes for MSP. This CPU-only layout makes no implemented DMA-"
"provider claim. No caller buffer is silently relocated into another memory "
"region."
msgstr ""
"RAM 为 0x20000000 起 80 KiB SRAM1、0x20014000 起 16 KiB SRAM2，以及系统总线 alias "
"0x20018000 起 32 KiB CCM。CPU CCM 地址 0x10000000 映射同一物理存储，不重复计数。首链接布局使用 "
"0x20000000 起连续 128 KiB，预留 2048 字节 MSP。此 CPU-only 布局不声明已实现 DMA "
"提供者，调用方缓冲不静默迁入其他内存域。"

